  "title": "Fourier Transform · study board",
  "items": {
    "scan": {
      "id": "scan",
      "type": "image",
      "assetId": "fourier-excerpt",
      "alt": "Page 70 of Engineering Signal Analysis: Time shift theorem",
      "transform": {
        "x": 122,
        "y": 190,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 360
      }
    },
    "q1": {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "为什么偏偏选复指数作基底？",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "bold": true,
      "transform": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": 560,
        "width": 470,
        "height": 55
      }
    },
    "p1": {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "普通基底也能展开函数，但平移之后各个系数会彼此混合。复指数的特别之处，是平移只改变一个相位。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "transform": {
        "x": 125,
        "y": 632,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 105
      }
    },
    "f1": {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "e^{ik(x-a)}=e^{-ika}e^{ikx}",
      "transform": {
        "x": 714,
        "y": 470,
        "width": 456,
        "height": 76
      }
    },
    "q2": {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "translation 为什么会变成乘法？",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "bold": true,
      "transform": {
        "x": 738,
        "y": 595,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 52
      }
    },
    "p2": {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "先只看一个频率。把 x 换成 x − a，指数律会把 a 从变量中分离出来。于是整个波形平移，频率仍然不变。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "transform": {
        "x": 736,
        "y": 680,
        "width": 505,
        "height": 112
      }
    },
    "derivation": {
      "id": "derivation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "我的推导\n\nf(x) = Σ cₖ eⁱᵏˣ\n\nf(x − a) = Σ cₖ eⁱᵏ⁽ˣ⁻ᵃ⁾\n             = Σ (cₖ e⁻ⁱᵏᵃ) eⁱᵏˣ\n\n所以每个频率的系数只多了一个相位因子。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "transform": {
        "x": 747,
        "y": 821,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 282
      }
    },
    "p3": {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "这就是算子的“特征函数”视角：函数的形状不变，只被一个数缩放。把复杂信号拆开以后，平移算子就容易理解了。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "transform": {
        "x": 1440,
        "y": 352,
        "width": 444,
        "height": 126
      }
    },
    "f2": {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "T_a e^{ikx}=e^{-ika}e^{ikx}",
      "transform": {
        "x": 1436,
        "y": 536,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 78
      }
    },
    "f3": {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\widehat{f(\\cdot-a)}(k)=e^{-ika}\\hat f(k)",
      "transform": {
        "x": 1404,
        "y": 684,
        "width": 484,
        "height": 84
      }
    },
    "example": {
      "id": "example",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "一个具体例子\n\n若 f(x) = cos(2x)，向右平移 π/4 以后：\ncos(2(x − π/4)) = sin(2x)。\n\n频率仍是 2，改变的是相位。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "transform": {
        "x": 1417,
        "y": 943,
        "width": 445,
        "height": 244
      }
    },
    "loose1": {
      "id": "loose1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "旁边再想想：如果信号不是周期的，基底还成立吗？",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "transform": {
        "x": 130,
        "y": 1040,
        "width": 475,
        "height": 81
      }
    },
    "loose2": {
      "id": "loose2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "待查：Fourier transform 与 Fourier series 的边界条件。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "transform": {
